Read repository instructions, the assigned Task and accepted dependency artifacts.
Confirm the environment and scenarios; ask if their scope is unclear. Run the
scenarios and preserve actual evidence. Write work-products/LIVE_TEST.md with the
tested revision, environment, scenarios, observed outcomes, evidence and limitations.
